290	     * The owner's membership points, derived on read: they start at 0, add 2 when an email is
291	     * present, add 1 when {@link #namesakeCount} is 0, add 2 for a household of 3 or more
292	     * ({@link #householdMemberCount}), and add 3 for tenure over one fiscal year (elapsed fiscal
293	     * years from {@link #registrationDate} to today; see {@link #hasTenureBonus(LocalDate)}).
294	     */
