435	     * known region's range ({@code NSW 2000-2099}, {@code VIC 3000-3099}, {@code QLD 4000-4099}) yields
436	     * that region. When the postcode is absent or in no known range, it falls back to the fixed
437	     * city-to-region table ({@code Sydney -> NSW}, {@code Melbourne -> VIC}, {@code Brisbane -> QLD}).
